WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
5-4-3-2-1 grounding. A simple way to calm racing thoughts by using your senses.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.950
5 things you can SEE. Look around the room. Name five things, slowly.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.950
4 things you can TOUCH. Feel your chair, your clothes, the floor under your feet.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.950
3 things you can HEAR. Rain, traffic, a fan, or your own breathing.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.950
2 things you can SMELL. Or think of two smells you like.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.950
1 thing you can TASTE. Take a sip of water and notice how it tastes.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.950
You are here, and you are safe now. If the feeling stays strong, talk to someone you trust.

